The Slipseer is an elven woman of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]] and a lieutenant of [[People/Althane/Karkov|Karkov]] in the [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]]. She wears the house's uniform and works beside his desk, reading the dossier the First House keeps on [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]]. [[People/Althane/Rampart|Rampart]] was her brother.

She is a scryer, and reaches after the Weft from a distance. When [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]] turned one of her spells back on her, he saw her in the room with Karkov, and she came away unable to scry him for a week.
